  (text "MIC INPUT NOTES\n- P48 phantom per IEC 61938: 6.81k 0.1 % matched feed pair, open-circuit ~48.6 V. SW501 switches it.\n- Hot-plug protection: 10R series + 1N4004 clamps to the +-16V rails + SMBJ18CA TVS on the rails.\n- U501 THAT1512: G = 0.5 + 5k / (5.1R + RV501) -> 0 dB to ~60 dB. 4700u cap blocks DC in the gain leg.\n- U502 makes a differential signal: 1 Vrms at PRE_OUT = 2 Vrms differential = 0 dBFS on CS5361\n  (full scale = 1.13 x VA = 5.65 V p-p differential at VA = 5 V).\n- U503 CS5361 slave mode, I2S, HPF on. M0/M1 speed mode set by XMOS per sample rate.\n  Unused right channel tied to VQ. OVFL drives the clip LED.\n- VERIFY: CS5361 FILT+/VQ capacitor values and input RC against the datasheet."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "3adc6175-2f3f-553d-853c-d6e4bf628ecd")
  )
)
